// Focused negative/state boundaries. Public handshake entry is used for wire
// ordering/metadata tests. Operations10+ explicitly inject private record/phase
// counters to reach otherwise enormous key-use limits; they prove no peer trust
// or successful handshake. Real authentication is covered by protocol.lani.
